<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post116127756758823511..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: Habeas Corpus Delicti</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116127756758823511/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/habeas-corpus-delicti.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>15</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116164500476249334</id><published>2006-10-23T17:10:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-10-23T17:10:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Mr. Call --Welcome! You make a good point regardin...</title><content type='html'>Mr. Call --&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Welcome! You make a good point regarding the way that the British Parliament&#39;s Declaratory Act -- which was THE chief provocation of the War for Independence -- was integrated wholesale into the Constitution&#39;s language regarding governance of D.C.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Since D.C. produces nothing but &quot;law&quot; and corruption, I&#39;m inclined to think that the District itself is a major abomination -- the Empire&#39;s floor drain, as it were. I wonder how different things would be if the constitutional status of the District were something other than it is.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116127756758823511/comments/default/116164500476249334'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116127756758823511/comments/default/116164500476249334'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/habeas-corpus-delicti.html?showComment=1161645000000#c116164500476249334' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/habeas-corpus-delicti.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116127756758823511' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116127756758823511' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 23, 2006 at 5:10 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116161476215152541</id><published>2006-10-23T08:46:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-10-23T08:46:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>&quot;[Habeus suspension]is one of the three major disf...</title><content type='html'>&quot;[Habeus suspension]is one of the three major disfiguring weaknesses of that noble text (the others being the Eminent Domain “takings” provision and the original language outlining the compromise on chattel slavery).&quot; &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;There is definitely another big one which should not be forgotten - &lt;BR/&gt;the power to &quot;legislate in &lt;B&gt;all cases whatsoever&lt;/B&gt;&quot; in the District - which has now been expanded to an &quot;unwarrantable jurisdiction&quot;.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Note that the &lt;B&gt;identical&lt;/B&gt; language was used in the Declaration, as an indictment against King George (the Earlier) and an abomination.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116127756758823511/comments/default/116161476215152541'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116127756758823511/comments/default/116161476215152541'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/habeas-corpus-delicti.html?showComment=1161614760000#c116161476215152541' title=''/><author><name>Mark Call</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13580953102890063069</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/habeas-corpus-delicti.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116127756758823511' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116127756758823511' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1243348124"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 23, 2006 at 8:46 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116161473180800978</id><published>2006-10-23T08:45:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-10-23T08:45:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>&quot;[Habeus suspension]is one of the three major disf...</title><content type='html'>&quot;[Habeus suspension]is one of the three major disfiguring weaknesses of that noble text (the others being the Eminent Domain “takings” provision and the original language outlining the compromise on chattel slavery).&quot; &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;There is definitely another big one which should not be forgotten - &lt;BR/&gt;the power to &quot;legislate in &lt;B&gt;all cases whatsoever&lt;/B&gt;&quot; in the District - which has now been expanded to an &quot;unwarrantable jurisdiction&quot;.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Note that the &lt;B&gt;identical&lt;/B&gt; language was used in the Declaration, as an indictment against King George (the Earlier) and an abomination.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116127756758823511/comments/default/116161473180800978'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116127756758823511/comments/default/116161473180800978'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/habeas-corpus-delicti.html?showComment=1161614700000#c116161473180800978' title=''/><author><name>Mark Call</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13580953102890063069</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/habeas-corpus-delicti.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116127756758823511' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116127756758823511' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1243348124"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 23, 2006 at 8:45 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116144167654624340</id><published>2006-10-21T08:41:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-10-21T08:41:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>to radical,if you&#39;re referring to me (as the flame...</title><content type='html'>to radical,&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;if you&#39;re referring to me (as the flamer and you as the flamee), then my apologies if i gave you the impression that i was ridiculing or flaming you.  :-)</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116127756758823511/comments/default/116144167654624340'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116127756758823511/comments/default/116144167654624340'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/habeas-corpus-delicti.html?showComment=1161441660000#c116144167654624340' title=''/><author><name>rick</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/12473173027048173880</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/habeas-corpus-delicti.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116127756758823511' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116127756758823511' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-870704727"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 21, 2006 at 8:41 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116143494750778066</id><published>2006-10-21T06:49:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-10-21T06:49:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>My apologies to the other posters &amp; to Will. I sho...</title><content type='html'>My apologies to the other posters &amp; to Will. I shouldn&#39;t react to being &quot;flamed&quot;.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116127756758823511/comments/default/116143494750778066'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116127756758823511/comments/default/116143494750778066'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/habeas-corpus-delicti.html?showComment=1161434940000#c116143494750778066' title=''/><author><name>A Radical Whig in Chattanooga</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/08489464838153487468</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/habeas-corpus-delicti.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116127756758823511' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116127756758823511' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-58288372"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 21, 2006 at 6:49 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116138592470093227</id><published>2006-10-20T17:12:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-10-20T17:12:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>The land purchase is near the triple border betwee...</title><content type='html'>&lt;I&gt;The land purchase is near the triple border between Paraguay, Brazil and Argentina, and stands over one of the largest reserves of fresh water on the planet, a gigantic aquifer that lies under parts of Brazil, Urugay, Paraguay and Argentina, and is larger than Texas and California put together.&lt;/I&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;From &lt;A HREF=&quot;http://www.unknowncountry.com/news/?id=5699&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;here.&lt;/A&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;(I stumbled onto it by accident, honest. I don&#39;t frequent that site. :)</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116127756758823511/comments/default/116138592470093227'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116127756758823511/comments/default/116138592470093227'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/habeas-corpus-delicti.html?showComment=1161385920000#c116138592470093227' title=''/><author><name>zchris63</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/15044325194992357871</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/habeas-corpus-delicti.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116127756758823511' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116127756758823511' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-60614549"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 20, 2006 at 5:12 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116138058824131814</id><published>2006-10-20T15:43:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-10-20T15:43:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>20 OctoberRick,    Congratuations on being a world...</title><content type='html'>20 October&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Rick,&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;    Congratuations on being a world traveler. No doubt, the Democrat party will quickly pick up on the Bush&#39;s purchasing 100,000 acres in South America.&lt;BR/&gt;    How many of the articles you found were based on the original reference?&lt;BR/&gt;    I will admit that I did not research the issue. However, it is a fact that in Mexico and in various European nations, the &quot;period&quot; and the &quot;comma&quot; are switched in numerical applications. However, I admit not to researching as to if the article referenced did indeed contain the correct format for us Muricans.&lt;BR/&gt;     I wasn&#39;t aware that we had a contest going. Grow up. Don&#39;t wait on your two dollars.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116127756758823511/comments/default/116138058824131814'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116127756758823511/comments/default/116138058824131814'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/habeas-corpus-delicti.html?showComment=1161380580000#c116138058824131814' title=''/><author><name>A Radical Whig in Chattanooga</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/08489464838153487468</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/habeas-corpus-delicti.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116127756758823511' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116127756758823511' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-58288372"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 20, 2006 at 3:43 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116137511588902558</id><published>2006-10-20T14:11:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-10-20T14:11:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>to a radical whig in ...somewhere.i got you beat m...</title><content type='html'>to a radical whig in ...somewhere.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;i got you beat man.  i got 1 year of living in france, 1 year in italy, 2 1/2 years in korea, and 3 years in germany.  i know about the decimal system.  no one in europe carries a number beyond two decimal places.  i just used a conversion program and plugged in 98,842 acres.  it doesn&#39;t convert to any round number in any metric measurements.  but i gotta admit, 98,842 acres is a lot and may be incorrect.  &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;if you do a google search using a boolean search: &quot;george bush and paraguay and 98... acres&quot;, they all come back the same.  98,842 acres.  it&#39;s not a decimal, but in fact a comma.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;sorry man. you lose.  &quot;i want my 2 dollars!&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;       --better off dead</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116127756758823511/comments/default/116137511588902558'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116127756758823511/comments/default/116137511588902558'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/habeas-corpus-delicti.html?showComment=1161375060000#c116137511588902558' title=''/><author><name>rick</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/12473173027048173880</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/habeas-corpus-delicti.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116127756758823511' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116127756758823511' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-870704727"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 20, 2006 at 2:11 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116136940017332502</id><published>2006-10-20T12:36:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-10-20T12:36:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>&quot;Arbustius Minimus&quot;!Mind if I use that?!</title><content type='html'>&quot;Arbustius Minimus&quot;!&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Mind if I &lt;I&gt;use&lt;/I&gt; that?!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116127756758823511/comments/default/116136940017332502'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116127756758823511/comments/default/116136940017332502'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/habeas-corpus-delicti.html?showComment=1161369360000#c116136940017332502' title=''/><author><name>Frank in Phoenix</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/10888244624383894458</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/habeas-corpus-delicti.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116127756758823511' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116127756758823511' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-424490522"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 20, 2006 at 12:36 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116136530015202536</id><published>2006-10-20T11:28:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-10-20T11:28:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Rick, here is a link that you might be able to use...</title><content type='html'>Rick, here is a link that you might be able to use to get a copy of the clip. http://www.crooksandliars.com/2006/10/18/countdown-special-comment-death-of-habeas-corpus-your-words-are-lies-sir/#more-11142</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116127756758823511/comments/default/116136530015202536'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116127756758823511/comments/default/116136530015202536'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/habeas-corpus-delicti.html?showComment=1161365280000#c116136530015202536' title=''/><author><name>Neo</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/08839164398247281003</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/habeas-corpus-delicti.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116127756758823511' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116127756758823511' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1580334153"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 20, 2006 at 11:28 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116136195182003608</id><published>2006-10-20T10:32:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-10-20T10:32:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>In quite a few foreign countries, to include Mexic...</title><content type='html'>In quite a few foreign countries, to include Mexico and various European countries, the &quot;period&quot; and &quot;comma&quot; are switched in their numerical functions. As such,the 98,842 acres might well actually be 98&quot;point&quot;842 acres, which is still a good sized homestead and makes more sense.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;No wonder we perform so poorly when we invade foreign countries!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116127756758823511/comments/default/116136195182003608'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/328691